From 76095c31ed695d77b5ba49292d0e142fcea0b6a2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 21:37:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Photo tab on Android (owner-approved design,
 plans/design/photo/; the Mac's cac27ff6)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- The stage: empty until this session's run (never the library's older stills);
  the run's photos at their shape with a strip, Photo n of 4, Keep highlighted,
  Redo, Upscale, Use in Shot and Share. Generate stays on the page.
- The panel: Inputs (Character, Outfit, Product, References) with clear empty
  slots, then the Rig for a still (Framing, Lens, Light, Look, Style); a preset
  locks Framing, Lens and Light.
- The bar: a Preset chip (menu with search and covers), Photos 1-4, Size (from
  the estimate; hidden on an older server), Auto · <model>, and Generate with
  the real price or Generate · 4 photos with the reason.
- PhotoRequest.aspect (sent only when picked); PhotoEstimate aspect, makes,
  aspects and model; demo mode lists them. The prompt hint names no one.
- Tests: SuitePhotoTest (size, estimate fields, demo), SuitePhotoScreenshotTest
  adds results and checks the Preset chip and the empty stage.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Py2rxoXQmfbR7CXwb939GC
